\textbf{Câu 7 (5,0 điểm).}[[br]]Vẽ hình đúng đến câu b.\hfill \textit{(0,25đ)}[[br]]\adjustbox{max width=0.42\linewidth}{\begin{tikzpicture}[line width=0.8pt, font=\small, scale=1.0]
\draw[ink] (0.000,0.000) -- (0.000,2.160) -- (2.880,0.000) -- cycle;
\draw[brand] (0.000,0.000) -- (1.037,1.382);
\draw[ink] (0.000,0.160) -- (0.160,0.160) -- (0.160,0.000);
\draw[ink] (0.941,1.254) -- (1.069,1.158) -- (1.165,1.286);
\fill[ink] (0.000,0.000) circle (1.2pt);
\fill[ink] (0.000,2.160) circle (1.2pt);
\fill[ink] (2.880,0.000) circle (1.2pt);
\fill[ink] (1.037,1.382) circle (1.2pt);
\node at (-0.184,-0.184) {$A$};
\node at (-0.110,2.396) {$B$};
\node at (3.124,-0.089) {$C$};
\node at (1.186,1.595) {$H$};
\end{tikzpicture}}[[br]]a) Áp dụng định lí Pythagore cho $\triangle ABC$ vuông tại $A$: $BC^2 = AB^2 + AC^2 = 144 + 256 = 400$.\hfill \textit{(0,5đ)}[[br]]Vậy $BC = 20$ cm.\hfill \textit{(0,25đ)}[[br]]b) Xét $\triangle ABH$ và $\triangle CBA$ có $\widehat{AHB}=\widehat{CAB}=90^\circ$, $\widehat{B}$ chung.\hfill \textit{(0,75đ)}[[br]]$\Rightarrow \triangle ABH \backsim \triangle CBA$ (g.g).\hfill \textit{(0,25đ)}[[br]]$\Rightarrow \dfrac{AB}{CB}=\dfrac{BH}{BA}$.\hfill \textit{(0,25đ)}[[br]]Vậy $AB^2 = BH\cdot BC$.\hfill \textit{(0,25đ)}
